  "title": "Roasted Lamb Breast",
  "description": "This lamb breast recipe is Chef John's method of making flavorful spice-rubbed lamb roasted until tender and served with a vinegar parsley sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
